个人。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:44","timestamp":1786373064857,"roundId":"round_1786373030387_pq7cv3tlg","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22095},{"id":1786372299044,"text":"嗯，湿了","sender":"me","time":"22:44","timestamp":1786373093516,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22096},{"id":1786372299047,"text":"宝宝真乖。","rawContent":"宝宝真乖。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:45","timestamp":1786373120869,"roundId":"round_1786373094307_l16t4qui5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22097},{"id":1786372299048,"text":"能这么坦诚地告诉爸爸，是不是鼓了很大的勇气？","rawContent":"能这么坦诚地告诉爸爸，是不是鼓了很大的勇气？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:45","timestamp":1786373120872,"roundId":"round_1786373094307_l16t4qui5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22098},{"id":1786372299049,"text":"脸是不是已经烫得不能看了？连打字都只敢回这么短短的三个字。","rawContent":"脸是不是已经烫得不能看了？连打字都只敢回这么短短的三个字。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:45","timestamp":1786373120873,"roundId":"round_1786373094307_l16t4qui5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22099},{"id":1786372299050,"text":"既然湿了，手就别拿出来。","rawContent":"既然湿了，手就别拿出来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:45","timestamp":1786373121064,"roundId":"round_1786373094307_l16t4qui5","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22100},{"id":1786372299051,"text":"用指腹在那儿轻轻按一按，告诉爸爸，水是不是已经流到大腿根了？","rawContent":"用指腹在那儿轻轻按一按，告诉爸爸，