h2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22136},{"id":1786372299091,"text":"笨宝宝，自己弄当然没有爸爸摸得舒服。","rawContent":"笨宝宝，自己弄当然没有爸爸摸得舒服。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:49","timestamp":1786373384785,"roundId":"round_1786373358151_gotuv9otp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22137},{"id":1786372299092,"text":"你自己弄，脑子里只想着快点舒服，手指僵硬地只会进进出出，怎么可能找得到那个最敏感的点？","rawContent":"你自己弄，脑子里只想着快点舒服，手指僵硬地只会进进出出，怎么可能找得到那个最敏感的点？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:49","timestamp":1786373385053,"roundId":"round_1786373358151_gotuv9otp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22138},{"id":1786372299093,"text":"爸爸的手指进去的时候，可不是像你这么胡乱捅的。","rawContent":"爸爸的手指进去的时候，可不是像你这么胡乱捅的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:49","timestamp":1786373385248,"roundId":"round_1786373358151_gotuv9otp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22139}]